# VideoBrief — YouTube

## Scope

YouTube URLs only. No uploads. No audio transcription.

## TranscriptProvider

- Default impl: `youtubei.js` (Innertube)
- Optional `YOUTUBE_PROXY_URL` (Webshare backbone gateway). When set, Innertube **and** caption fetch share one undici `ProxyAgent` with a sticky session per ingest. Unset locally; set on Vercel.
- Callers stay on `TranscriptProvider` — they must not import proxy or youtubei.js.

## English only

Prefer/require **English** caption tracks. If no accessible English timestamped transcript → user-facing error; do not fall back to Whisper or other languages.

Preserve segment timestamps for section sync.

## Metadata

Fetch title, channel, duration, thumbnail via the same provider boundary. Persist on **`user_videos`** per user; refresh on every ingest/re-paste.

Paste creates a stub and **redirects to the workspace immediately**. Metadata + transcript fetch run there; YouTube failures surface on the workspace failed pane.

## Player

Use **`react-youtube`** for the workspace (IFrame API):

- Poll or listen for current time → highlight active section
- Section click → `seekTo`
- Sync is client-only; no AI during playback

Do not use lite-embed for the workspace (insufficient control).
